      "measure_count": 10,
      "limits": "Two NEM regions only; no Australian average, retail bill, forecast or moving 24-hour window. Prices are the published rounded TRADE values, not a claim of finality. Monthly files may be revised. Zero after cent rounding does not establish an exactly zero higher-precision dispatch price. Equal-interval mean is not demand-weighted.",
